mutanen da suke zaune tare da kulawa da juna? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me ya kamata ka nuna wa iyaye? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-01.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-01.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me ake kira mutanen da suke zaune tare da kulawa da juna?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"iyali\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"iyali\",\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"filin wasa\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka nuna wa iyaye?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"girmamawa\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"girmamawa\",\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"ƙin magana\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ake kira mutanen da suke zaune tare da kulawa da juna?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"iyali\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"makaranta\",\n          \"hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane abu iyali yake ba yaro?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kulawa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"ƙura\",\n          \"tsoro\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka nuna wa iyaye?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"girmamawa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"raini\",\n          \"ƙin ji\",\n          \"gardama\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane ƙaramin aiki yaro zai iya yi a gida?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"tattara littafi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"lalata kaya\",\n          \"jefa shara\",\n          \"ɓoye takalmi\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me iyali yake yi idan akwai matsala?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"tattaunawa cikin natsuwa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"faɗa kullum\",\n          \"barin gida\",\n          \"ƙin sauraro\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"track\": \"formal\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n    \"gapTeaser\": null,\n    \"chainNext\": null,\n    \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n    \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-02\",\n    \"gradeband\": \"p2\",\n    \"subject\": \"Social Studies\",\n    \"subjectHa\": \"Nazarin Zamantakewa\",\n    \"moduleNumber\": 2,\n    \"titleEn\": \"Members of the Family\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Membobin Iyali\",\n    \"titleAjami\": null,\n    \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Membobin iyali su ne mutane daban-daban da suke cikin gida ko dangi. Uwa tana kula da yara, uba yana taimaka wajen jagoranci da bukatun gida, kakanni suna ba da shawara da labari, yayye suna taimaka wa ƙanne, ƙanne kuma suna koyo daga manya. A wasu gidaje, za ka iya zama da kawu, inna, ko ɗan uwa. Kowane gida yana iya bambanta, amma muhimmanci shi ne kulawa da juna. Ka san sunayen mutanen gidanku, ka kuma san yadda za ka gaishe su da ladabi. Idan babba ya kira ka, ka amsa cikin natsuwa. Idan ƙani ya bukaci taimako, ka taimaka idan za ka iya. Sanin membobin iyali yana taimaka maka ka fahimci dangantaka, alhaki, da zaman lafiya a gida. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Membobin Iyali. [MAIN] Membobin iyali su ne mutane daban-daban da suke cikin gida ko dangi. Uwa tana kula da yara, uba yana taimaka wajen jagoranci da bukatun gida, kakanni suna ba da shawara da labari, yayye suna taimaka wa ƙanne, ƙanne kuma suna koyo daga manya. A wasu gidaje, za ka iya zama da kawu, inna, ko ɗan uwa. Kowane gida yana iya bambanta, amma muhimmanci shi ne kulawa da juna. [PAUSE 1] Wace ce mace mai kula da yara a gida? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Wa ke iya ba da shawara da labari a iyali? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-02.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-02.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wace ce mace mai kula da yara a gida?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"uwa\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"uwa\",\n          \"kasuwa\",\n          \"allo\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wa ke iya ba da 