{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"node -e \\\"const d=require('./tools/p5-batch/p5-bsci.json'); const m=d.find(x=>x.textExplanationHa?.includes('Taba da giya')); console.log(JSON.stringify(m,null,2))\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"id\": \"p5-bsci-15\",\n  \"gradeband\": \"p5\",\n  \"subject\": \"Basic Science\",\n  \"subjectHa\": \"Kimiyya\",\n  \"moduleNumber\": 15,\n  \"titleEn\": \"Harmful Substances and Drug-Awareness Safety\",\n  \"titleHa\": \"Kariya Daga Abubuwa Masu Cutarwa\",\n  \"titleAjami\": null,\n  \"ajami_validated\": false,\n  \"textExplanationHa\": \"Wasu abubuwa suna iya cutar da jiki da tunani. Taba da giya ba su dace da yara ba. Haka kuma, kada yaro ya karɓi ko ya sha maganin da iyaye, likita, ko ma'aikacin lafiya bai ba shi ko amince da shi ba. Ko magani mai amfani ga mutum ɗaya yana iya zama marar dacewa ga wani, saboda haka ba a rabawa ko gwadawa. Idan wani ya ba ka taba, giya, ko maganin da ba a amince da shi ba, ka ce a'a cikin natsuwa, ka matsa zuwa wuri mai aminci, kada ka ɗanɗana, riƙe, karɓa, ko yin gwaji da shi. Ka sanar da babban da ka yarda da shi nan da nan, kamar iyaye, malami, ko mai kula da kai. Kada ka yi gardama, ka fuskanci mutum, ko ka binciki abin da yake yi. Mutanen da suke fama da matsala suna bukatar mutunci da taimakon ƙwararru, ba zagi ko kunyatawa ba. A aikin hoto, ka zaɓi matakai uku masu aminci: cewa a'a, matsawa, da sanarwa.\",\n  \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Yau za mu koyi matakai masu aminci idan aka ba yaro abu mai cutarwa. [MAIN] Taba da giya ba su dace da yara ba. Kada ka karɓi maganin da iyaye, likita, ko ma'aikacin lafiya bai amince da shi ba. Maganin wani ba naka ba ne. [PAUSE 1] Me za ka ce idan aka ba ka irin wannan abu? [MAIN] Ka ce a'a, ka matsa zuwa wuri mai aminci, kada ka ɗanɗana, riƙe, karɓa, ko gwadawa, sannan ka sanar da babban da ka yarda da shi. Kada ka yi gardama ko bincike. A mutunta kowa ba tare da zagi ba. [PAUSE 2] Wa za ka sanar? [OUTRO] Ka haddace matakai uku: ka ce a'a, ka matsa, ka sanar da babban da ka yarda da shi.\",\n  \"audioFile\": \"audio/p5-bsci-15.mp3\",\n  \"imageCard\": \"images/p5-bsci-15.png\",\n  \"microPauses\": [\n    {\n      \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n      \"questionHa\": \"Me za ka ce idan aka ba ka irin wannan abu?\",\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"a'a\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"a'a\",\n        \"zan gwada\",\n        \"zan riƙe\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n      \"questionHa\": \"Wa za ka sanar?\",\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"babban da na yarda da shi\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"babban da na yarda da shi\",\n        \"babu kowa\",\n        \"jariri\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"quizQuestions\": [\n    {\n      \"templateHa\": \"Wa zai amince da maganin yaro?\",\n      \"answerFormula\": \"iyaye, likita, ko ma'aikacin lafiya\",\n      \"variableRanges\": {\n        \"a\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        },\n        \"b\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"distractorFormulas\": [\n        \"baƙon da ba a sani ba\",\n        \"wani yaro\",\n        \"duk mai bayarwa\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"templateHa\": \"Me za ka yi bayan ka ce a'a?\",\n      \"answerFormula\": \"ka matsa zuwa wuri mai aminci\",\n      \"variableRanges\": {\n        \"a\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        },\n        \"b\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"distractorFormulas\": [\n        \"ka ɗanɗana\",\n        \"ka riƙe\",\n        \"ka yi gardama\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"templateHa\": \"Shin maganin wani naka ne?\",\n      \"answerFormula\": \"a'a\",\n      \"variableRanges\": {\n        \"a\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        },\n        \"b\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"distractorFormulas\": [\n        \"eh, koyaushe\",\n        \"eh, idan yana da launi\",\n        \"eh, idan babu babba\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"templateHa\": \"Yaya ya dace a yi magana game da mai matsala?\",\n      \"answerFormula\": \"cikin mutunci ba tare da zagi ba\",\n      \"variableRanges\": {\n        \"a\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        },\n        \"b\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"distractorFormulas\": [\n        \"a kunyata shi\",\n        \"a zage shi\",\n        \"a bincike shi\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"templateHa\": \"Waɗanne matakai uku ne na aminci?\",\n      \"answerFormula\": \"cewa a'a, matsawa, da sanarwa\",\n      \"variableRanges\": {\n        \"a\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        },\n        \"b\": {\n          \"min\": 0,\n          \"max\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"distractorFormulas\": [\n        \"ɗanɗanawa, riƙewa, da ɓoyewa\",\n        \"karɓa, gwadawa, da rabawa\",\n        \"gardama, bincike, da zargi\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"track\": \"formal\",\n  \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n  \"gapTeaser\": null,\n  \"chainNext\": null,\n  \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n  \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
